{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43411","headline":"白雪歌 · 无名氏","name":"白雪歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇穹何处飞琼屑，散下人间作春雪。\n五花马踏白云衢，七香车碾瑶墀月。\n苏岩乳洞拥山家，涧藤古栗盘银虵。\n寒郊复叠铺柳絮，古碛烂熳吹芦花。\n流泉不下孤汀咽，断臂老猿声欲绝。\n鸟啄冰潭玉镜开，风敲檐溜水晶折。\n拂户初疑粉蝶飞，看山又讶白鸥归。\n孙康冻死读书围，火井不煖温泉微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}